      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Delivery selection",
      "items": [
        "Occupancy and ConditionVariables built first, then scenarios whose conditions match (or named in apply_scenarios)",
        "Deliveries = scenario-enabled + inclusion: default + the call's delivery block, less disabled ones",
        "Per delivery, at send time: priority and delivery conditions checked"
